                    "text": [
                        "✅ Model بارگذاری شد\n",
                        "   - تعداد پارامترها: 1,100,048,384\n",
                        "   - Device: cuda:0\n",
                        "   - Dtype: torch.float16\n",
                        "   - تخمین حافظه VRAM: 2098.18 MB (~2.05 GB)\n",
                        "\n",
                        "🧪 تست سریع مدل:\n",
                        "   Input: Hello, my name is\n",
                        "   Output: Hello, my name is [Your Name] and I am a [Your Position] at [Your Company]. I am writing\n",
